  "stem_markdown": "### 5. 已知函数 $f(x)$ 在定义域内可导， $f(x)$ 的大致图象如图所示，则其导函数 $f'(x)$ 的大致图象可能为（）\n\n![](assets/15a6a25b8c8bf64aa167400c17aaa7cc5f1b8061f9f6245aadeab87a5cd5a944.jpg)\n\nA.\n\n![](assets/39856c921bb2e785847955b2bbf5e803797796fb5c466ee662b0462ee70e95a2.jpg)\n\nB.\n\n![](assets/8c082822e69be1291f98bdef38147191dafeab9f0bd8f496e81d2bcf130eb37b.jpg)\n\nC.\n\n![](assets/c55839bff1480878a9a1e24fe0ba3fa6173a3fbe70d3e3d58b5a45bbbbfda788.jpg)\n\nD.",
  "stem_html": "<h3>5. 已知函数 $f(x)$ 在定义域内可导， $f(x)$ 的大致图象如图所示，则其导函数 $f'(x)$ 的大致图象可能为（）</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/15a6a25b8c8bf64aa167400c17aaa7cc5f1b8061f9f6245aadeab87a5cd5a944.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>A.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/39856c921bb2e785847955b2bbf5e803797796fb5c466ee662b0462ee70e95a2.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>B.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/8c082822e69be1291f98bdef38147191dafeab9f0bd8f496e81d2bcf130eb37b.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>C.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/c55839bff1480878a9a1e24fe0ba3fa6173a3fbe70d3e3d58b5a45bbbbfda788.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>D.</p>",
  "options": {
    "A": "![](assets/39856c921bb2e785847955b2bbf5e803797796fb5c466ee662b0462ee70e95a2.jpg)",
    "B": "![](assets/8c082822e69be1291f98bdef38147191dafeab9f0bd8f496e81d2bcf130eb37b.jpg)",
